    "content": "<article class=\"pb-16 space-y-12\"><div class=\"bg-[#EEF5FF]/80 border-b border-[#99BFF9]/20 py-3\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[#5A6270]\"><nav class=\"flex items-center space-x-2\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"hover:text-[#2A548E] transition-colors\">Home</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-3 h-3 text-[#5A6270]/40\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[#2A548E] font-medium\">Privacy Policy</span></nav></div></div><header class=\"pt-8 pb-8 border-b border-[#99BFF9]/25\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-4 text-center sm:text-left\"><div class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#226E56] font-semibold\">Legal &amp; Data Protection</div><h1 class=\"font-serif-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-[#1E232B] font-normal leading-[1.18] text-balance\">Privacy Policy</h1><p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-[#5A6270] leading-relaxed\">Privacy policy and data protection practices for Science of Gifts.</p></div></header><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-base text-[#1E232B] leading-relaxed\"><div class=\"markdown-body space-y-6\"><h2 class=\"font-serif-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#1E232B] font-normal pt-6 pb-2 border-b border-[#99BFF9]/25\">Privacy Policy</h2>\n<p class=\"text-base text-[#1E232B] leading-[1.8]\">How Science of Gifts handles and protects reader information.</p>\n<hr class=\"border-t border-[#99BFF9]/30 my-8\"/>\n<h2 class=\"font-serif-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#1E232B] font-normal pt-6 pb-2 border-b border-[#99BFF9]/25\">1. Information We Collect</h2>\n<p class=\"text-base text-[#1E232B] leading-[1.8]\">Science of Gifts values your privacy. We collect minimal information necessary to deliver our publication and provide newsletter subscriptions:</p>\n<ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-base text-[#5A6270] my-4\">\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed text-[#1E232B]\"><strong class=\"font-semibold text-[#1E232B]\">Email Addresses:</strong> If you subscribe to our newsletter (&quot;The Sunday Curation&quot;), we collect your email address solely to deliver requested editorial updates. You may unsubscribe at any time.</li>\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed text-[#1E232B]\"><strong class=\"font-semibold text-[#1E232B]\">Aggregated Analytics:</strong> We collect standard, privacy-preserving aggregated data (such as page views and browser types) to understand how readers interact with our guides and improve the publication.</li>\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed text-[#1E232B]\"><strong class=\"font-semibold text-[#1E232B]\">Local Storage:</strong> Features like your &quot;Saved Gifts Shortlist&quot; are stored locally on your device in browser storage and are never transmitted to or stored on our servers.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr class=\"border-t border-[#99BFF9]/30 my-8\"/>\n<h2 class=\"font-serif-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#1E232B] font-normal pt-6 pb-2 border-b border-[#99BFF9]/25\">2. Cookies &amp; External Links</h2>\n<p class=\"text-base text-[#1E232B] leading-[1.8]\">When you click an affiliate link to a merchant or artisan site, third-party affiliate networks may set a temporary tracking cookie to record the referral. We do not sell your personal data to data brokers or third parties.</p>\n<hr class=\"border-t border-[#99BFF9]/30 my-8\"/>\n<h2 class=\"font-serif-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#1E232B] font-normal pt-6 pb-2 border-b border-[#99BFF9]/25\">3. Contact Us</h2>\n<p class=\"text-base text-[#1E232B] leading-[1.8]\">If you have any questions or wish to request deletion of your newsletter subscription data, contact our privacy desk at <a href=\"mailto:privacy@scienceofgifts.com\" class=\"text-[#2A548E] font-medium underline hover:text-[#1B365D] transition-colors\">privacy@scienceofgifts.com</a>.</p></div></div></article>"
